{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫派出近百藝員為《萬千星輝賀台慶》拍序幕，有份拍攝的吳偉豪、周嘉洛及林凱恩受訪，同屬《愛．回家之開心速遞》的3人表示沒有收到入《三代同糖》的消息，但隨時ready好，嘉洛表示入得三代同糖的都是強將，笑言：「唔使我哋啦！</p><p>」，間接幫吳偉豪和林</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:44:06.385638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:37:14.225568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:37:14.225568+00:00","content_hash":"1b44a9e53ff0191a122453407f3ccab1a324c85229674ca232e09165c4e56f60","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}